      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gohery Properties are delighted to bring to the market this impressive ground floor 2 bed apartment in beautiful condition. Located close to the Galway Clinic, mid-way between Oranmore and Galway city with easy access to both. The accommodation is bright and airy with large kitchen /dining / living area, 2 bedrooms, main bathroom. The apartment was recently refurbished with new flooring, completely new bathroom and refurbished kitchen."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "⭐ 2-bedroom ground floor apartment \r\n⭐ Recently refurbished\r\n⭐ Extends to 61.56 sq mts (662 sq.ft.) accommodation\r\n⭐Modern internal finishes with new flooring, bathroom and refurbished kitchen\r\n⭐ Managed apartments €600 p.a.\r\n⭐ Very convenient location close to Galway Clinic, access to motorway and rail services, just 20 mins from city centre and 5 mins from Oranmore or Briarhill shopping centre\r\n⭐ Electric heating"
      },
